%% A Gantt chart: a release.
gantt
    title Release plan
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %d %b
    excludes weekends
    includes 2026-03-07
    todayMarker off
    section Build
    Design review       :done, des1, 2026-03-02, 3d
    Implement features  :active, imp1, after des1, 10d
    section Ship
    Release candidate   :crit, rc1, after imp1, 5d
    Announce            :milestone, 2026-03-27, 0d
